---
const heroImage = "/images/gallery/CREADORES_1.1.1.jpg";
---

<section
  id="home"
  class="relative min-h-[100svh] flex items-end overflow-hidden"
  aria-label="Inicio"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      src={heroImage}
      alt=""
      class="hero-still absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center"
      width="1920"
      height="1080"
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-background-primary/35"></div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-background-primary via-background-primary/55 to-background-primary/20"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-background-primary/85 via-background-primary/25 to-transparent"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/60 to-transparent"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-24 md:pt-36">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="hero-enter mb-8">
        <span class="flex items-end gap-4 md:gap-5">
          <img
            src="/images/logos/logo_creadores.png"
            alt=""
            class="h-14 w-14 md:h-20 md:w-20 object-contain shrink-0 drop-shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,180,236,0.35)]"
            width="80"
            height="80"
          />
          <span
            class="font-gaming font-black text-white tracking-[-0.03em] text-[clamp(2.75rem,11vw,7rem)] leading-[0.9]"
          >
            CREADORES
          </span>
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p
        class="hero-enter hero-enter-delay text-lg md:text-2xl text-text-secondary max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-10"
      >
        El documental sobre quienes hacen videojuegos en Chile: sus sueños, sus fricciones y la obstinación de crear desde aquí.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-enter hero-enter-delay-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4">
        <a
          href="#trailer"
          class="group inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-3.5 bg-primary hover:brightness-110 text-on-primary font-bold text-lg rounded-lg transition-[filter,transform] duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
        >
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              fill-rule="evenodd"
              d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM9.555 7.168A1 1 0 008 8v4a1 1 0 001.555.832l3-2a1 1 0 000-1.664l-3-2z"
              clip-rule="evenodd"
            />
          </svg>
          <span>Ver Tráiler</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="#capitulos"
          class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 border-2 border-white/80 text-white hover:border-primary hover:text-primary font-bold text-lg rounded-lg transition-colors duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
        >
          <span>Ver Capítulos</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-still {
    transform: scale(1.08);
    animation: hero-drift 28s ease-out forwards;
  }

  @keyframes hero-drift {
    from {
      transform: scale(1.12) translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    }
    to {
      transform: scale(1.02) translate3d(0, -1.5%, 0);
    }
  }

  .hero-enter {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate3d(0, 1.25rem, 0);
    animation: hero-rise 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.12s forwards;
  }

  .hero-enter-delay {
    animation-delay: 0.28s;
  }

  .hero-enter-delay-2 {
    animation-delay: 0.42s;
  }

  @keyframes hero-rise {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-still,
    .hero-enter,
    .hero-enter-delay,
    .hero-enter-delay-2 {
      animation: none !important;
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
